# Scope decision — ticket 127 is about code style.
#
# Markdown is excluded because Prettier reflows prose and re-aligns tables, and
# this repository's docs are evidence: ADRs, audit tables and runbooks whose
# column alignment and line breaks were written deliberately. Reformatting them
# is churn against the thing being recorded.
#
# Workflow and manifest YAML is excluded because its value is partly literal:
# `deploy-workflow.test.ts` asserts exact shell fragments, and the workflows
# embed multi-line shell where indentation is semantics rather than style.
*.md
*.yml
*.yaml

# Agent/editor configuration, not project source.
.impeccable/
.claude/
